{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, think big, and build your way up in a harsh underground world. Grow and package your own product, strike risky deals, and move it across dangerous territory\u2014all while avoiding cops, rival dealers, and the cartel. Every decision matters, and one mistake can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money, upgrade your operation, and climb your way from street-level hustler to kingpin. But in this business, trust is rare, and freedom never comes cheap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow and Harvest:</strong> Cultivate plants, process your product, and manage resources to keep your supply moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell to Survive:</strong> Meet shady buyers, trade cash and goods, and negotiate for the best deal\u2014or your safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade the Law:</strong> Watch for police patrols, hide evidence, and stay one step ahead of the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Base:</strong> Secure stash spots, upgrade equipment, and manage production safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World:</strong> Explore a living world with changing weather, time, and NPC activity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward:</strong> Take dangerous jobs for quick cash or play it safe and stay under the radar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Caught, Do Time:</strong> End up behind bars and break rocks in prison to earn your release.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140960?t=1762545614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4140960?t=1762545614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140960/612331cc80513530713804bc236a9f732ff7b5bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762545614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140960/612331cc80513530713804bc236a9f732ff7b5bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762545614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features drug use, trafficking, and criminal activity, including growing and selling illegal substances. It also contains violence, strong language, and themes of imprisonment and law enforcement. The game does not promote real-world drug use or crime."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, think big, and build your way up in a harsh underground world. Grow and package your own product, strike risky deals, and move it across dangerous territory\u2014all while avoiding cops, rival dealers, and the cartel. Every decision matters, and one mistake can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money, upgrade your operation, and climb your way from street-level hustler to kingpin. But in this business, trust is rare, and freedom never comes cheap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow and Harvest:</strong> Cultivate plants, process your product, and manage resources to keep your supply moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell to Survive:</strong> Meet shady buyers, trade cash and goods, and negotiate for the best deal\u2014or your safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade the Law:</strong> Watch for police patrols, hide evidence, and stay one step ahead of the system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Base:</strong> Secure stash spots, upgrade equipment, and manage production safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World:</strong> Explore a living world with changing weather, time, and NPC activity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward:</strong> Take dangerous jobs for quick cash or play it safe and stay under the radar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Caught, Do Time:</strong> End up behind bars and break rocks in prison to earn your release.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Naht Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4140960/f74f77237652ae69a51f0e6768c05a36d21da38a/header.jpg?t=1762545614","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey 12.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 / Intel Core i5 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140960/2070012819/4b016ade10174d44d02ef85e438cabb7ca0b2e88/1762545211/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762545611","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140960/2070012819/4b016ade10174d44d02ef85e438cabb7ca0b2e88/1762545211/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762545611","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4140960/2070012819/4b016ade10174d44d02ef85e438cabb7ca0b2e88/1762545211/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762545611","id":257228353,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228353/c6be7fdc543662df59c30aeff0913381e34b8bd4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762545611"}],"name":"Route Zero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3